// Static warning block
---
<div class="rounded-md bg-yellow-50 p-4 border border-yellow-200">
  <div class="flex">
    <div class="flex-shrink-0">
      <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-yellow-400" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.257 3.099c.765-1.36 2.722-1.36 3.486 0l5.58 9.92c.75 1.334-.213 2.98-1.742 2.98H4.42c-1.53 0-2.493-1.646-1.743-2.98l5.58-9.92zM11 13a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-8a1 1 0 00-1 1v3a1 1 0 002 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="ml-3">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">Safety Constraints (Phase 2)</h3>
      <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-yellow-700">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>No Launch Button:</strong> The Release Readiness manager does not execute a deployment.</li>
          <li><strong>No Live Delivery:</strong> Paid-social and GTM commands operate exclusively in DRY_RUN or DRAFT mode.</li>
          <li><strong>No Consent Overrides:</strong> Manual injection of purchase conversions or consent circumvention is strictly forbidden by the infrastructure layer.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
